            "review_title": "Review at Liu Chu Fang",
            "review_text": "M.T\n20 contributions\n0\nService need to be improved\nApr 2021 • Friends\nthey are one of good option for combo bbq and hotpot in DN with cheap price (compared with small buffet restaurant market)\nBuffet counters provide variety of food choices (salads, hot food, sashimi, dessert...) however, sashimi is not fresh \nStaff will ignore you when they are busy. We asked more than twice and waited to have dessert eating utensils but finally received back their ignorance, there were no any eating utensils at dessert counter at 7:45pm\n\nI will definitely not come back again but do hope they can improve their service\nRead more\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten April 10, 2021",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-04",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
