            "review_title": "Review at Liu Chu Fang",
            "review_text": "Minh Tuan P\nDa Nang, Vietnam183 contributions\n0\nOk for a hot pot night\nOct 2017 • Friends\nThe overall review was generally good. \nNice and cozy decoration with spacious dining area. Large selection of choice for dipping sauces and hotpot topping (vegetable and meats). Really good hot pot broth which you can choose from a selection of 6 broth types. \nThere are some significant Chinese dishes such as dim sum etc. \nThe only uncomfortable thing was that you have to move and pick up your choice of dipping sauce which is quite unpleasant. You have to do it bit by bit with a small bow and have to fill up time by time. It was quite annoying, especially when you on a middle of good dinning mood\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten October 16, 2017",
